                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "5741af8f-d49c-454f-b6ba-b1c0d50e9f82",
                        "entry_id": "465179e0-5313-3560-bbc5-29a0dfcd8a60",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "altright"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2b8f3c9f-b407-3da2-bece-28267ee6ce59",
                        "entry_id": "465179e0-5313-3560-bbc5-29a0dfcd8a60",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Mouvement d’extrême droite, conspirationniste, nationaliste blanc, suprémaciste blanc, LGBTphobe, anti-immigration et anti-féministe des États-Unis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7636d45-dfd1-47a4-a0a6-de857a34bd6d",
                                "sense_id": "2b8f3c9f-b407-3da2-bece-28267ee6ce59",
                                "text": "L’alt-right est une mouvance d’extrême droite née à la fin des années 2000, mais qui s’appuie sur des références racistes relativement classiques."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4ec24fd-60e5-4de5-a193-e2728e7b373b",
                                "sense_id": "2b8f3c9f-b407-3da2-bece-28267ee6ce59",
                                "text": "Être conservateur ne suffit plus, il faut désormais tendre vers l’extrême droite, frayer avec l’alt-right et les suprémacistes blancs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4fcf199c-3197-4771-bb93-6251fc556984",
                                "sense_id": "2b8f3c9f-b407-3da2-bece-28267ee6ce59",
                                "text": "Le personnage de comics avait été récupéré par l’alt-right américaine, puis par l’extrême droite en France."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee132b28-3cd7-4d5f-a702-d31b6df58cc1",
                                "sense_id": "2b8f3c9f-b407-3da2-bece-28267ee6ce59",
                                "text": "Ils défendent une idéologie nationaliste, autoritaire et antidémocratique via les réseaux sociaux, et s’inspirent grandement des tactiques militantes de l’alt right étatsunienne."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8c31e255-8626-3327-833a-4c78daad1874",
                        "entry_id": "465179e0-5313-3560-bbc5-29a0dfcd8a60",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Courant de pensée de même nature dans un autre pays que les États-Unis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e3e607c-5d10-4497-93b7-6cdbd6979e0d",
                                "sense_id": "8c31e255-8626-3327-833a-4c78daad1874",
                                "text": "En France, l’alt-right n’aurait pu rêver mieux que l’intervention récente de la Ministre : l’« islamo-gauchisme » pourrait être en train de corrompre les têtes pensantes de nos Universités ; propos amplifié par le Ministre de l’Éducation Nationale qui le voit « comme un fait social indubitable »."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "84061040-5b59-487b-b46a-e90b1a20f2aa",
                        "source_entry_id": "465179e0-5313-3560-bbc5-29a0dfcd8a60",
                        "target_lang_word": "Alt-Right",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "10b0da4b-9fe6-49e5-8f67-0ab55e468607",
                        "source_entry_id": "465179e0-5313-3560-bbc5-29a0dfcd8a60",
                        "target_lang_word": "alt-right",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "alt-right",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6c2b234-2594-360f-96e6-567631e3469b",
                                        "entry_id": "bf27d477-18d9-3b1a-80e6-e960a273465d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An amorphous movement of right-wing white nationalists opposed to multiculturalism and egalitarianism by race and sex, mostly active on the Internet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24dbbbfc-c165-4a51-b6c6-57a58aeb6575",
                                                "sense_id": "c6c2b234-2594-360f-96e6-567631e3469b",
                                                "text": "So a right without a Buckley will probably be smaller, and uglier to boot. I would expect this alt-right to be a lot more vigorously opposed to the civil rights movement than OTL's. It will also be much less relevant, and probably not snag a certain Californian actor. I predict, then, that America, on the whole, looks a bit more like a Western European social democracy, but with a right wing that looks (hmm...thinking...) well, looks almost fascist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4401afbd-3d58-4779-abc9-acf66ad27f92",
                                                "sense_id": "c6c2b234-2594-360f-96e6-567631e3469b",
                                                "text": "\"But the cultural conflict between these two post-revolutionary styles — between frat guys and feminist bluestockings, Gamergaters and the diversity police, alt-right provocateurs and 'woke' dudebros, the mouthbreathers who poured hate on the all-female 'Ghostbusters' and the tastemakers who pretended it was good — is likely here to stay.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99b99f7c-52da-4341-8d1a-7e8959a54d79",
                                                "sense_id": "c6c2b234-2594-360f-96e6-567631e3469b",
                                                "text": "The choice is between a polemicist with deep ties to the alt-right movement, or a conventional policy professional with an open channel to the political establishment that Trump ran against, but which he needs to pass an agenda."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9671ffb9-5800-305e-a4e9-73dde11d24b2",
                                        "entry_id": "bf27d477-18d9-3b1a-80e6-e960a273465d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of the alt-right; an alt-righter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "alt-right",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f6048567-e941-34ef-93f6-bf818ed43710",
